{"title":"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/c/73c2cebdbc524624cf9bab853640b2d6e8b00320.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" />, The minimum value of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/2/aa22800c9dc909617ff7be5875dc7131a461ad2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+50y+\\frac{625}{xy^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"116\" height=\"42\" /> is achieved at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed47ef35959c171399e8f18eed4b517223823c04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=a$\" width=\"44\" height=\"8\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/f/dff3b56795afc9981c804f07bd528186b6e4d7f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/4/aa416ed9edf5c273410def99cd1782b125b4a08e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"81\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rewrite:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7ef274baf19a4e28439f00e724f1e78efcb5acf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+50y+\\frac{625}{xy^2}=x+25y+25y+\\frac{625}{xy^2}\\]\" width=\"299\" height=\"41\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/c/73c2cebdbc524624cf9bab853640b2d6e8b00320.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" />, we can apply the AM-GM inequality:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/9/c39bf3c4c85821a48fe512bbe7b65cfab93c3e78.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x+25y+25y+\\frac{625}{xy^2}}{4}\\ge\\sqrt[4]{(x)(25y)(25y)\\left(\\frac{625}{xy^2}\\right)}=\\sqrt[4]{25^4}=25\\]\" width=\"478\" height=\"53\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/3/263eeebd98cc0373ee14c843130f5a4cc7041aff.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+25y+25y+\\frac{625}{xy^2}\\ge100\\]\" width=\"214\" height=\"41\" />\nSince the minimum holds when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/a/95a02467a8ec0a778cff5b9143252a50ac1a2f53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=25y=\\frac{625}{xy^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"120\" height=\"42\" />, then:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/6/406eb9552227a6b297a250b7272bb93cd85fbe47.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=25y, \\, \\frac{625}{xy^2}=25y \\implies \\frac{625}{25y^3}=25y\\]\" width=\"296\" height=\"41\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/9/079bcfc6dde9f5029706ba316b9de1203250e5b0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[625=625y^4\\implies y^4=1\\]\" width=\"194\" height=\"19\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/3/cf32406671fc9a01b1982019404e3f981a0f56b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />, then the only real solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c3b4834614e5e7e189cb7d621cfb4fb0bd36dd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/2/b729c655a8c754f3b0c9698b89e445ecbfe00f90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=25y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/f/08f7cfaaaac737ada39fc1450e9a5319e01a9038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=25$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />. And therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/4/aa416ed9edf5c273410def99cd1782b125b4a08e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"81\" height=\"16\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/4/3940a732f3b2f375c3e49a1faa56c4ddfe9b74c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+25+25=\\boxed{51}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"145\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO\">2026 Indonesia District MO </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 12 (page does not exist)\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_D